        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: The Killers of Comedy Tour\n- People: Beetlejuice, Reverend Bob Levy, Sal Governale, Richard Christy, Jim Florentine, Yucko the Clown, Shuli\n- Organizations: The Howard Stern Show\n- Topics: stand-up comedy\n\nFacts:\n- The Killers of Comedy Tour features cast members and regulars from The Howard Stern Show.\n- The Killers of Comedy Tour includes Reverend Bob Levy, Sal Governale, Richard Christy, Jim Florentine, Yucko the Clown, and Shuli as stand-up comedy performers.\n- Beetlejuice, whose surname is Green, has performed with various comedians related to The Howard Stern Show.\n- Beetlejuice has performed with comedians who appear under The Killers of Comedy Tour banner.",
